{"unit_id":"trynewthin__dsh-subagent-roles#feature-1","repo":"trynewthin/dsh-subagent-roles","commit":"83f118cfc217c7388d542bcdd63b01b60f77fa21","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-roles 的功能「查看角色路由」：主代理调用 subagent_roles 可查看已配置角色、选择描述和模型路由；没有角色时会返回未配置提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:10-31"]}
